4.What is database management system 
:
 dbms (database management system)
Dbms is a software which used to store the data.
● Dbms is a software which used to perform Crud operations with Database Server.
 
--> dbms is a software which allows to create and manage the database.
--> the database which is created by using dbms software uses files for storing the data.
 
--> files are having disadvantages.
disadvantages of files 
1. data redundency (duplicate data)
2. data inconsistency
3. no data recovery
4. limited data
5. no query language
6. no security

●●rdbms (relational database management system)
 
--> rdbms is the advance version of dbms
--> rdbms is a software which allows to create and manage the database.
 
●Rdms is used to store or manage the data only in the form of tables
--> the database which is created using rdbms software uses tables for
storing the data.
●RDBMS data is structured in database tables, fields (columns) and records (rows)
 advantages of rdbms
I, no data redundancy
2, data consistency
3. data recovery
4 unlimited data
5 query language support
6, security
 
